Subject: [PATCH] Neko LineageOS: Settings: add memory safety compatibility
 mode switch

Expose the per-app Scudo compatibility switch and warn before enabling it
for apps that may handle payment or financial data.

Change-Id: I8956a918509999db3c19aa00e2334cf8988ac848
